    {
      // The city's roadworks and street-use permits restricting traffic
      // within the next two weeks, as points (222 on 2026-10-28): a static
      // file rewritten daily, in EPSG:25832, which its `crs` names. Same
      // SBOD system as Aachen's BSIS but a different export: `AKZ` is the
      // file reference (unique), BEGINN/ENDE are dotted calendar dates.
      // VORGNAME separates roadworks (167) from general street-use permits
      // (55: scaffolding, cranes, material storage), both roadworks here, as
      // in Aachen. SPERR_ART codes the restriction, matched against the
      // ART_VB text: 10 footway, cycle path, verge or parking only, 11 lane
      // narrowing, 12 one side closed, 13 full closure; 20/22/23 carry the
      // same texts as 10/12/13. 0 (8) is traffic safety only, with no
      // restriction, and is dropped; 16 records have no code.
      // ART_VB lists the restrictions and is the description; the 5
      // SONDERINFO notes are not read. AUFTRAGGEBER_EMAIL (contractors'
      // addresses) stays in the raw record only.
