      // two-digit years ("13.04.26 - 30.10.26", "19.08.26 - Bis auf
      // Weiteres") that the reader cannot parse, and are not mapped.
      // SYMBOL_ID picks the map icon and is undocumented; read against the
      // descriptions, 2 is a full closure (33 of 37 say "vollständig
      // gesperrt") and 4 a one-way regime (4 of 6 name an Einbahnstraße),
      // while 1 mixes lane closures, traffic lights and staged closures and
      // stays unknown. maxRecordCount is 1000.
      "subdivision": "nw",
      "operator": "duisburg",
      "product": "events",
      "name": "Stadt Duisburg roadworks (Verkehrsportal)",
