      // (CQL_FILTER, 1,054 points, 0.7 MB instead of 2.6 MB), and the filter
      // below repeats that so a server ignoring the CQL still yields only RLP.
      // Points come back lon/lat for EPSG:4326. The companion `mwvlw:verlauf`
      // (affected-road lines) and `mwvlw:umleitung` (detours) join by a
      // `baustelleId` this layer's properties do not carry, so they are not read.
      // The stable id is the GeoJSON feature id ("baustelle.<SperrinfoSys id>",
      // unique across all 1,054); no property identifies a record (28 share
